(1) A data user shall by written notice inform a data subject—
(a) that personal data of the data subject is being processed by or on behalf of the data user,
and shall provide a description of the personal data to that data subject;
(b) the purposes for which the personal data is being or is to be collected and further
processed;
(c) of any information available to the data user as to the source of that personal data;
